          "generalFeedback": "A core idea of ATDD is shared authorship of the acceptance criteria. The Three Amigos — business/PO, developer, tester — specify them together so the whole team owns one definition of \"done\". Treating it as a testers-only handoff loses the shared understanding that gives ATDD its value.",
          "single": true
